begin="00:32.548" end="00:33.941">間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻柔的节奏</span></p><p begin="00:34.198" end="00:39.427" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:34.198" end="00:34.678">像</span><span begin="00:34.678" end="00:35.046">吉</span><span begin="00:35.046" end="00:35.369">他</span><span begin="00:35.369" end="00:35.669">用</span><span begin="00:35.669" end="00:35.917">力</span><span begin="00:35.917" end="00:36.247">刷</span><span begin="00:36.247" end="00:36.961">錯幾</span><span begin="00:36.961" end="00:37.231">個</span><span begin="00:37.231" end="00:37.816">和</span><span begin="00:37.816" end="00:39.427">弦</span></p><p begin="00:40.438" end="00:43.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:40.438" end="00:40.932">時</span><span begin="00:40.932" end="00:41.282">間</span><span begin="00:41.282" end="00:41.586">過</span><span begin="00:41.586" end="00:41.858">了</span><span begin="00:41.858" end="00:42.568">幾</span><span begin="00:42.568" end="00:43.946">年</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔跑著 投出雪球 脸颊觉得冷飕飕的</span></p><p begin="00:44.245" end="00:49.263" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:44.245" end="00:44.660">我</span><span begin="00:44.660" end="00:44.966">想</span><span begin="00:44.966" end="00:45.324">我</span><span begin="00:45.324" end="00:45.624">們</span><span begin="00:45.624" end="00:45.966">都</span><span begin="00:45.966" end="00:46.296">忘</span><span begin="00:46.296" end="00:46.617">了</span><span begin="00:46.617" end="00:46.874">彼</span><span begin="00:46.874" end="00:47.188">此</span><span begin="00:47.188" end="00:47.805">的</span><span begin="00:47.805" end="00:49.263">臉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">做出了两个大雪球</span></p><p begin="00:50.527" end="00:53.796" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:50.527" end="00:50.964">難</span><span begin="00:50.964" end="00:51.283">道</span><span begin="00:51.283" end="00:51.595">這</span><span begin="00:51.595" end="00:51.903">叫</span><span begin="00:51.903" end="00:52.548">有</span><span begin="00:52.548" end="00:53.796">緣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把他们重叠起来 便就做好了呀</span></p><p begin="00:54.306" end="00:58.644" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:54.306" end="00:54.732">我</span><span begin="00:54.732" end="00:54.962">沒</span><span begin="00:54.962" end="00:55.288">想</span><span begin="00:55.288" end="00:55.641">過</span><span begin="00:55.641" end="00:55.948">我</span><span begin="00:55.948" end="00:56.294">們</span><span begin="00:56.294" end="00:56.595">會</span><span begin="00:56.595" end="00:56.992">再</span><span begin="00:56.992" end="00:57.543">遇</span><span begin="00:57.543" end="00:58.644">見</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冰冷的「我」的身体 在你的触碰下就像要融化一样</span></p><p begin="00:58.917" end="01:05.126" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:58.917" end="00:59.328">故</span><span begin="00:59.333" end="00:59.733">事</span><span begin="00:59.733" end="01:00.098">已</span><span begin="01:00.098" end="01:00.972">經</span> <span begin="01:01.234" end="01:01.876">翻</span><span begin="01:01.876" end="01:02.225">了</span><span begin="01:02.225" end="01:02.902">幾</span><span begin="01:02.902" end="01:05.126">頁</span></p><p begin="01:06.773" end="01:11.772" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:06.773" end="01:07.026">忽</span><span begin="01:07.026" end="01:07.180">然</span><span begin="01:07.180" end="01:07.537">之</span><span begin="01:07.537" end="01:07.871">間</span> <span begin="01:07.871" end="01:08.192">你</span><span begin="01:08.192" end="01:08.493">忽</span><span begin="01:08.493" end="01:08.786">略</span><span begin="01:08.786" end="01:09.017">的</span> <span begin="01:09.017" end="01:09.442">我</span><span begin="01:09.442" end="01:10.006">忽略</span><span begin="01:10.006" end="01:10.306">的</span> <span begin="01:10.306" end="01:10.642">所</span><span begin="01:10.642" end="01:10.956">有</span><span begin="01:10.956" end="01:11.277">細</span><span begin="01:11.277" end="01:11.772">節</span></p><p begin="01:11.818" end="01:16.702" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:11.818" end="01:12.179">當</span><span begin="01:12.179" end="01:12.527">初</span><span begin="01:12.527" end="01:12.787">的</span><span begin="01:12.787" end="01:13.149">猜</span><span begin="01:13.149" end="01:13.470">疑</span><span begin="01:13.470" end="01:13.722">好</span><span begin="01:13.722" end="01:14.023">奇</span> <span begin="01:14.023" end="01:14.406">愛</span><span begin="01:14.406" end="01:14.734">恨</span><span begin="01:14.734" end="01:15.062">痴</span><span begin="01:15.062" end="01:15.369">嗔</span> <span begin="01:15.369" end="01:15.711">卻</span><span begin="01:15.711" end="01:16.032">已</span><span begin="01:16.032" end="01:16.340">走</span><span begin="01:16.340" end="01:16.702">遠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看到了你的「我」 突然之间就爱上了你</span></p><p begin="01:16.805" end="01:21.674" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:16.805" end="01:17.051">忽</span><span begin="01:17.051" end="01:17.265">然</span><span begin="01:17.265" end="01:17.555">之</span><span begin="01:17.555" end="01:17.858">間</span> <span begin="01:17.858" end="01:18.168">你</span><span begin="01:18.168" end="01:18.444">發</span><span begin="01:18.444" end="01:18.774">現</span><span begin="01:18.774" end="01:18.988">的</span> <span begin="01:18.988" end="01:19.401">我</span><span begin="01:19.401" end="01:19.711">發</span><span begin="01:19.711" end="01:20.021">現</span><span begin="01:20.021" end="01:20.305">的</span> <span begin="01:20.305" end="01:20.642">所</span><span begin="01:20.642" end="01:20.965">有</span><span begin="01:20.965" end="01:21.254">改</span><span begin="01:21.254" end="01:21.674">變</span></p><p begin="01:21.772" end="01:31.692" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:21.772" end="01:22.196">當</span><span begin="01:22.196" end="01:22.593">初</span><span begin="01:22.593" end="01:22.877">的</span><span begin="01:22.877" end="01:23.190">微</span><span begin="01:23.190" end="01:23.475">笑</span><span begin="01:23.475" end="01:23.815">眼</span><span begin="01:23.815" end="01:24.002">淚</span> <span begin="01:24.002" end="01:24.441">喜</span><span begin="01:24.441" end="01:24.739">怒</span><span begin="01:24.739" end="01:25.038">哀</span><span begin="01:25.038" end="01:25.378">樂</span> <span begin="01:25.378" end="01:25.761">都</span><span begin="01:25.761" end="01:26.046">已</span><span begin="01:26.046" end="01:26.345">拋</span><span begin="01:26.345" end="01:27.036">在</span><span begin="01:27.210" end="01:27.691">昨</span><span begin="01:27.691" end="01:31.692">天</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但那个瞬间 「我」便已经开始融化 到了再见的时间</span></p><p begin="01:32.294" end="01:34.598" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:32.294" end="01:32.756">Oh,</span> <span begin="01:32.756" end="01:34.598">whoa</span></p><p begin="01:48.065" end="01:51.532" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:48.065" end="01:48.492">那</span><span begin="01:48.492" end="01:48.830">一</span><span begin="01:48.830" end="01:49.144">年</span><span begin="01:49.144" end="01:49.387">的</span><span begin="01:49.387" end="01:50.087">蛻</span><span begin="01:50.087" end="01:51.532">變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间渐渐流逝 四周披上了银装</span></p><p begin="01:51.759" end="01:56.341" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:51.759" end="01:52.182">像</span><span begin="01:52.182" end="01:52.898">手術</span><span begin="01:52.898" end="01:53.137">拿</span><span begin="01:53.137" end="01:53.395">掉</span><span begin="01:53.395" end="01:53.765">塞</span><span begin="01:53.765" end="01:54.057">住</span><span begin="01:54.057" end="01:54.377">心</span><span begin="01:54.377" end="01:54.738">上</span><span begin="01:54.738" end="01:55.249">的</span><span begin="01:55.249" end="01:56.341">繭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪妖精的游戏 已经很久没玩了吧</span></p><p begin="01:58.068" end="02:01.626" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:58.068" end="01:58.525">還</span><span begin="01:58.525" end="01:58.826">疼</span><span begin="01:58.826" end="01:59.143">痛</span><span begin="01:59.143" end="01:59.453">的</span><span begin="01:59.453" end="02:00.027">感</span><span begin="02:00.027" end="02:01.626">覺</span></p><p begin="02:01.780" end="02:06.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:01.780" end="02:02.200">像</span><span begin="02:02.200" end="02:02.543">傷</span><span begin="02:02.543" end="02:02.878">口</span><span begin="02:02.878" end="02:03.152">總</span><span begin="02:03.152" end="02:03.418">得</span><span begin="02:03.418" end="02:03.800">需</span><span begin="02:03.800" end="02:04.034">要</span><span begin="02:04.034" end="02:04.432">時</span><span begin="02:04.432" end="02:04.698">間</span><span begin="02:04.698" end="02:05.072">復</span><span begin="02:05.072" end="02:06.963">原</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">换以水手服和背包</span></p><p begin="02:07.989" end="02:11.596" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:07.989" end="02:08.495">掌</span><span begin="02:08.495" end="02:08.826">管</span><span begin="02:08.826" end="02:09.173">命</span><span begin="02:09.173" end="02:09.458">運</span><span begin="02:09.458" end="02:09.986">的</span><span begin="02:09.986" end="02:11.596">神</span></p><p begin="02:11.765" end="02:17.429" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:11.765" end="02:12.167">多</span><span begin="02:12.167" end="02:12.561">想</span><span begin="02:12.561" end="02:12.895">問</span> <span begin="02:12.895" end="02:13.126">祢</span><span begin="02:13.126" end="02:13.478">是</span><span begin="02:13.478" end="02:13.744">不</span><span begin="02:13.744" end="02:14.095">是</span><span begin="02:14.095" end="02:14.438">打</span><span begin="02:14.438" end="02:14.754">了</span><span begin="02:14.754" end="02:15.107">個</span><span begin="02:15.107" end="02:17.429">盹</span></p><p begin="02:1